## Database Tables (Do Not Rename)

`tenants` | `tenant_members` | `staged_leads` | `leads` | `jobs` | `job_logs`

All in SQLite WAL at: `podconnect_leads.db` (project root)
Full schema: `docs/05_Schema.md`

---

## API Route Prefix

All authenticated routes: `/api/*` (requires `Authorization: Bearer <token>` + `X-Tenant-ID` header)
Public routes: `/api/health` only

---

## Environment

- OS: Android 16 / Termux aarch64
- Node: v24.22.1 (`node:sqlite` built-in available)
- Python: 3.14 (for `scraper.py`)
- Run dev: `npm run dev` (tsx server.ts)
- Build: `npm run build` (vite build)
- Type check: `npm run lint` (tsc --noEmit)
